# Revenue Workspace

When editing the customer-centric workspace shell or lifecycle-tab content:

- **`docs/03-customer-workspace.md`** — CustomerContextBar, RecordHeader action pill, list-then-detail
- **`docs/04-lifecycle-tabs.md`** — per-tab specs (Overview, Tasks, Threads, Quote, Contract, …)
- **`docs/07-dynamic-status.md`** — insight/NBA derivation (journey rail status is unused)
- **`docs/02-design-system.md`** — badges, spacing
- **`docs/11-workspace-cleanup-and-gating.md`** — tab gating, list-then-detail

## Key rules

1. All detail routes render through `CustomerRevenueWorkspace` — no standalone pages.
2. Statuses, insights, NBAs are **derived** via `derive-stage-data.ts` — never hardcoded.
3. Live chrome: **`CustomerContextBar`** file-folder tabs + optional **`RecordHeader`** (actions only, portaled).
4. Import `Stage` from `stage.ts` — not removed journey-rail module.
5. Don't gate downstream tabs when an **active prior contract exists**.
6. Revenue recognition is independent of cash receipt.
